+All accepted_context digests are external manager/consumer anchors. Merely
+computing a hash of caller data conveys no authority. Fixture outputs are
+separate and can never enter the production registry. This API never changes
+Catalog accounting, deletes FM, supplies payload or converts death into ACK.
